  m_text: "<smallcaps>Greetings! I'm <b><i><allcaps>Gepeto-A.I. </allcaps></i></b>and
    I'll be your trusty helper for solving the levels. If you need a hint or just
    want to chat feel free to press the button and I\u2019ll give you a hint! Don\u2019t
    be shy, I don\u2019t bite <i><color=#B8B8B8>(I would if I had any teeth\u2026)</color></i></smallcaps>"
